  <div class="faq_accordion">
    <div class="accordion" id="accordionExample">
      <div class="container-fluid">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-12">
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button
                  class="accordion-button collapsed"
                  type="button"
                  data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#collapseOne"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="collapseOne"
                >
                  Can i use multiple server at same time or can i order same
                  link on multiple service at same time?
                </button>
              </h3>
              <div
                id="collapseOne"
                class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample"
              >
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p>
                    Please note, this is an automated server & server just see
                    your start count and he mark as complete when he saw your
                    quantity reach from start count, no metter your
                    likes/quantity comes from where. <br />
                    <br />
                    So please don't use multiple website or multiple order at
                    same time on same link.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button
                  class="accordion-button collapsed"
                  type="button"
                  data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#collapseTwo"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="collapseTwo"
                >
                  Why you not refill my orders?
                </button>
              </h3>
              <div
                id="collapseTwo"
                class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample"
              >
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p>
                    1. If our system send extra quntity, no refill for extra
                    delivery. If your old or new follows drop we also not refill
                    for it. Our system only check start count and now how you
                    much. If system not found any drop accourding to start count
                    we can't refill for it. & the refill system works only when
                    drop ratio is more then %10, for some services it work when
                    drop ratio is more then %5 <br />
                    <br />
                    2. If start count goes down we can't refill or refund,
                    before asking for refill you must fill the start count so we
                    can refill.
                    <br />
                    <br />
                    3. If your order on same link at same time we also unable to
                    refill.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button
                  class="accordion-button collapsed"
                  type="button"
                  data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#collapseThree"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="collapseThree"
                >
                  Why {{ site['site_name'] }} sell fix rate services?
                </button>
              </h3>
              <div
                id="collapseThree"
                class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample"
              >
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p>
                    As a wholesale provider we always try to selling services
                    with minimum profit, some of services our profit is only %1
                    & other all not more then %5, we are also made bonus %3-5 on
                    high deposit, so we are unable to give any kinds of
                    discounts.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button
                  class="accordion-button collapsed"
                  type="button"
                  data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#collapseFour"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-controls="collapseFour"
                >
                  Can i get a discount or custom rate?
                </button>
              </h3>
              <div
                id="collapseFour"
                class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                data-bs-parent="#accordionExample"
              >
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p>
                    We are the wholesale smm service provider, our all rate fix
                    for resellers. No need for custom rate, Sorry to inform you
                    that, we do not offer any discount. We sell service with
                    very low profit and there is no way to provide more
                    discount. <br /><br />
                    After all if need extra discount, please deposit high value
                    for get extra on
                    <a href="/addfunds" class="link">add funds</a
                    >.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

